"Daily protein and consistent training matter most. Small trials support balanced meals for muscle protein synthesis; long-term muscle-growth results are mixed." = "全天蛋白質和持續訓練更重要。小規模試驗支援均衡分配促進肌肉蛋白合成，但長期增肌效果的研究結果並不一致。";
"Carbs start at 25% for breakfast, 35% for lunch and 40% for dinner. With a snack, 15% goes to the snack and the remaining 85% follows the same split." = "碳水起始分配為早餐 25%、午餐 35%、晚餐 40%。開啟點心後，點心佔 15%，剩餘 85% 按上述比例分配。";
"These percentages are an app planning default, not a proven optimal ratio. A small trial found faster sleep onset with a high-GI meal four hours before bed; other trials found no benefit. More dinner carbs do not guarantee better sleep or justify cutting dinner protein." = "這些比例是 App 的起始安排，並非經驗證的最佳比例。一項小規模試驗發現睡前四小時的高 GI 餐可縮短入睡時間，其他試驗未發現改善。晚餐多吃碳水並不保證睡得更好，也不代表應該減少晚餐蛋白質。";
