"Masso reads all authorized sleep-analysis history: core, deep, REM, unspecified sleep, awake and in-bed samples, with times and sources. Missing stages stay blank. Overlapping sources are not added together; detailed stage data is preferred for nightly totals. These totals may differ from Apple's source priorities. In-bed time is not sleep time." = "Masso 讀取獲授權的完整睡眠歷史：核心、深睡、REM、未分期睡眠、清醒和臥床紀錄，包含時間和來源。缺失分期不填零。重疊來源不累加，每晚優先採用詳細分期資料；與 Apple 的來源優先順序不同可能導致總量差異。臥床時長不等於睡眠時長。";
