"Solid blue means actual sleep reaches your saved nightly target. Awake and time in bed are excluded. Deep and REM are references, not scoring targets." = "實際睡眠時長達到當晚儲存的目標，才顯示實藍。清醒和臥床時間不計入；深睡和 REM 僅供參考，不參與判定。";
"Solid yellow requires all three daily macro targets. The lower end of the carb/fat ranges is the completion threshold; the upper end is guidance, not a reason to eat extra." = "蛋白質、碳水和脂肪都達到當天目標，才顯示實黃。碳水／脂肪範圍的下限用於判斷達標，上限是建議，不鼓勵額外攝入。";
"Color bands are Masso's display rules, not medical thresholds. Today has a white outline. Home's oldest three dots also fade for layout." = "顏色檔位是 Masso 的展示規則，不是醫學閾值。今天用白色圓環標記；首頁最左側三天還有額外的視覺淡出。";
"Completion = actual sleep minutes ÷ that night's target. Values above the target earn no extra credit. Stage estimates do not determine the color." = "完成度＝實際睡眠分鐘數÷當晚目標。超過目標不額外加分，睡眠階段估算不決定顏色。";
"The daily Diet score compares protein, carbs and fat with fixed daily targets (weights 20/10/5); each macro is capped at 100%, so extra intake cannot offset another shortfall. Meal cards show that meal's weighted contribution to the full daily targets as a percentage, not a score." = "每日飲食評分按蛋白質、碳水和脂肪的固定日目標計算（權重為 20/10/5）；每項最高計 100%，多餘攝入不能抵消其他營養素的不足。每餐卡片則顯示本餐對全天目標的加權貢獻百分比，不是評分。";
"Only saved meal records count. AI nutrition estimates can be inaccurate; colors measure recorded target adherence, not diet quality or health." = "僅儲存後的餐點計入。AI 營養估算可能有誤差；顏色表示已記錄攝入的目標達成度，不代表飲食品質或健康程度。";
"Saved historical targets take priority. If a day has no saved target, the current target is used; changing today's goal does not overwrite saved goals." = "優先採用當天儲存的目標；沒有歷史目標時採用目前目標。修改今天的目標不會覆蓋已儲存的歷史目標。";
"Adults generally need 7–9 hours; ages 13–18 need 8–10 hours and ages 6–12 need 9–12 hours. Eight hours is an adult starting point. A blue dot only confirms your chosen goal, not that your sleep is healthy." = "成人通常需要 7–9 小時；13–18 歲通常需要 8–10 小時，6–12 歲需要 9–12 小時。8 小時是成人的起點。藍色僅表示達到你設定的目標，不代表睡眠健康評估。";
"ISSN supports about 1.4–2.0 g/kg/day of protein for most healthy exercising adults. Masso's targets are planning starting points. Its 20/10/5 weights and color bands are product choices, not research-validated health scores." = "ISSN 建議多數健康成人運動人群每天約攝入 1.4–2.0g／kg 蛋白質。Masso 的目標是規劃起點；20／10／5 權重及顏色檔位是產品設定，不是經研究驗證的健康評分。";
"ACSM · Nutrition and athletic performance (2016)" = "ACSM · 營養與運動表現（2016）";
