"Your goal is weekly. Rest days do not count as failed daily goals." = "目標按週計算，休息日不代表未達標。";
"Green means at least one recorded training set that day." = "綠色表示當天至少紀錄了一組訓練。";
"Gray means no recorded training sets that day." = "灰色表示當天沒有訓練組紀錄。";
