"Gray appears after the two-day recovery window when there is no workout." = "訓練後兩天恢復期結束且當天無訓練時顯示灰色。";
"Recovery colors are for context and do not count toward your weekly target. Today has a white outline; the oldest three home dots fade for display only." = "恢復色僅供參考，不計入週目標。今天有白色描邊；首頁最早三天淡化僅為視覺處理。";
"Each day with recorded training sets counts once, even if you complete several workouts. This week's count follows your calendar settings and is compared with your current weekly target." = "有訓練組紀錄的日期計為一天，同一天多次訓練只計一次。本週按你的日曆設定統計，並與目前每週目標比較。";
"Only logged workout days count toward your weekly target. The two recovery shades are a simple display rule, not a measurement of muscle recovery or workout intensity." = "只有有訓練紀錄的日期計入週目標。訓練後兩天的恢復色僅作參考，不代表實際肌肉恢復或訓練強度。";
"Why this target?" = "為什麼設定這個目標？";
"Your fixed gram targets use the weight, training goal and weekly training frequency saved in Masso. If you are 65 or older, the protein factor is raised modestly. Meal count only divides the daily targets; it does not change them." = "固定克數目標根據你在 Masso 儲存的體重、訓練目標和每週訓練天數計算。65 歲及以上會適度提高蛋白質係數。餐數隻影響每餐分配，不改變全天目標。";
"Carbohydrate uses your goal and planned training days, with a 130 g adult reference floor. Fat uses a simple 0.8 g/kg planning value. These are practical estimates, not measured calorie needs or medical prescriptions." = "碳水按訓練目標和計畫訓練天數計算，並設有成人每日 130 克的參考下限。脂肪按每公斤體重 0.8 克估算。這些是實用規劃值，不是測得的熱量需求或醫療處方。";
"Masso does not currently collect height or body composition, so it cannot estimate energy needs precisely. Sleep duration is not used to change macro grams because there is no established formula for doing that." = "Masso 目前沒有收集身高或體脂組成，因此無法精確估算能量需求。睡眠時長也不會用於調整營養素克數，因為目前沒有可靠的換算公式。";
"ISSN describes protein needs as a range, not one proven ideal for every person. Masso selects a fixed planning point from body weight and training goal; carbohydrates also reflect planned weekly training days, and fat uses a simple weight-based estimate. Age modestly raises the protein factor from 65 onward. Height, body composition, medical conditions and reliable daily energy expenditure are not collected, so these values are estimates rather than a personalized clinical prescription. Sleep data is not used to change macro targets because there is no established conversion from sleep duration to daily macro grams. Scoring weights and color bands are product choices, not research-validated health scores." = "ISSN 將蛋白質需求描述為一個範圍，並沒有證實適用於所有人的單一最佳值。Masso 根據體重和訓練目標選取固定規劃值；碳水也參考每週計畫訓練天數，脂肪則按體重估算。65 歲起適度提高蛋白質係數。由於目前沒有收集身高、體脂組成、健康狀況或可靠的每日能量消耗，這些數值屬於估算，不是個人醫療處方。睡眠時長沒有公認的換算方式，因此不會用於調整宏量營養素目標。評分權重和顏色分級是產品規則，不是經研究驗證的健康評分。";
